    "chunk_text": "1AIV (w) jeks fldgi \u2014 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'11'22PART IV(A) \u2014 GAZETTE EXTRA ORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 22.11.2019\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nwxl 2150$71 - 2019 fkdje\u00efn\u00be ui 22 jeks isl=rdod - 2019'11'22No. 2150/71 - FRIDAY NOVEMBER 22, 2019\n\nEXTRAORDINARYThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n(Published by Authority)PART IV (A) \u2014 PROVINCIAL COUNCILS\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nProvincial Councils Notifications\n\nSABARAGAMUWA PROVINCE PROVINCIAL COUNCIL\n\nSabaragamuwa Provincial Council - 2019\n\nSECOND SUPPLEMENTARY FINANCIAL STATEMENT\n\nGRANTING PERMISSION BY VIRTUE OF POWERS VESTED IN ME UNDER SECTION 27(A) OF PROVINCIAL COUNCIL ACT, NO. 42\n\nOF 1987 AS THE TERM OF THE SIXTH SABARAGAMUWA PROVINCIAL COUNCIL OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA ENDED ON 26 TH SEPTEMBER, 2017.\n\n2019\n\n1.This permission may be cited as \u201cPermission to disburse under second financial statement - 2019 of theSabaragamuwa Provincial Council\u201d and come in to operation from 16th, September 2018.\n\n2.I do hereby grant premission to the Chief Secretary of this province and other accounting officers of theSabaragamuwa Provincial Council to disburse the province and other accounting officers of the SabargamuwaProvincial Council to expenditure of the Sabaragamuwa Provincial Council which is estimated Rupees ThirtyFour Billion Twenty Three Million, Four Hundred and Six Thousand One Hundred and Ninety Seven andCents Twenty Four Only (Rs. 34,023,406,197.24) for the service of the period beginning on 01st of January2019 and ending 31st December, 2019, which is specified as \u201cFinancial Year 2019\u201d in the Budget Estimate -2019, that was approved on 10.04.2019 and amended by First Supplementary Statement - 2019.\n\n3.Accordingly the first Schedule of the said amended Gazette Notification is amended as the first schedulehereof and grant permission to disburse the same."
  },
