    "chunk_text": "1AIV (w) jeks fldgi \u2014 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'11'22PART IV(A) \u2014 GAZETTE EXTRA ORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 22.11.2019\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nwxl 2150$72 - 2019 fkdje\u00efn\u00be ui 22 jeks isl=rdod - 2019'11'22No.2150/72 - FRIDAY NOVEMBER 22, 2019\n\nEXTRAORDINARYThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n(Published by Authority)PART IV (A) \u2014 PROVINCIAL COUNCILS\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nProvincial Councils Notifications\n\nSABARAGAMUWA PROVINCE PROVINCIAL COUNCIL\n\n2019\n\nThird Supplementary Financial Statement\n\nGRANTING PERMISSION BY VIRTUE OF POWERS VESTED IN ME UNDER SECTION 27(A) OFPROVINCIAL COUNCIL ACT, No. 42 OF 1987 AS THE TERM OF THE SIXTH SABARAGAMUWA PROVINCIALCOUNCIL OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA ENDED ON 26 TH SEPTEMBER, 2017\n\n2019\n\n1.This permission may be cited as ''Permission to disburse under third financial statement - 2019 of theSabaragamuwa Provincial Council'' and come in to operation from 09.10.2019\n\n2.The expenditure of the Sabaragamuwa Provincial Council which is estimated Rupees Thirty Four BillionTwenty Three Million, Four Hundred and Six Thousand One Hundred and Ninety Seven and Cents TwentyFour only (Rs. 34,023,406,197.24) for the service of the period beginning on 01st of January 2019 andending on 31st December, 2019, which is specified as \u201dFinancial Year 2019\u201d in the Budget Estimate - 2019,that was approved on 10.04.2019 and amended by First and Second Supplementary Financial Statement -2019, is hereby amended as, Rupees Thirty Four Billion Fifty Seven Million Eight Hundred and Six ThousandOne Hundred Ninety Seven and Cents Twenty Four Only (Rs. 34,057,806,197.24) and grant permission tothe Chief Secretary of this Province and other Accounting Officers to disburse the same from theSabaragamuwa Provincial Council Fund."
