    "chunk_text": "1AIII fldgi \u2013 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h \u2013 2019'11'22PART III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 22.11.2019\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nNotice under Section 33\n\nRef. No.: WEG/LAN/LI/ACQ/27.\n\nI, K. P. G. Sumith Shantha, Divisional Secretary of Weligama inMatara District do hereby notify that due compensation and interestfor the acquisition of lands which are fully described in thefollowing schedule hereto. Rupees One Hundred and Ninety EightThousand Six Hundred and Forty Nine and Twenty Two cents(Rs. 198,649.22) in Case No. MLA 14768 at District Court ofMatara, Rupees One Hundred and Ninety Eight Thousand SixHundred and Forty Nine and Twenty Two cents (Rs. 198,649.22)in Case No. MLA 14775 and Rupees Seven Thousand FiveHundred Seventy Three and Fifteen cents (Rs. 7,573.15) in CaseNo. MLA 11705 at District Court of Matara have been depositedfor making payment to the claimants.\n\nK. P. G. Sumith Shantha,Divisional Secretary,Weligama.\n\nAt Divisional Secretariat, Weligama.18th November, 2019.\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%hThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nw;s \u00fafYI EXTRAORDINARY\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART III \u2013 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\nwxl 2150$75 \u2013 2019 fkdje\u00efn\u00be 22 jeks isl=rdod \u2013 2019'11'22No. 2150/75 \u2013 FRIDAY, NOVEMBER 22, 2019\n\nSCHEDULE\n\nFollowing allotments of land depicted in P.P. MR 1777 situated inthe Village of Kapparathota in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division ofWeligama in Matara District:\n\nLot No. 01The compensation and interest amount for the extent of0.0523 Hectare which was not claimed out of the land calledJothikoratuwa alias Kohuwala Kurunduwatta in total extent of1.1520 Hectare is Rs. 198,649.22.Case No.: MLA 14768."
