    "chunk_text": "I fldgi ( ^I& fPoh - YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'11'25PART I : SEC. (I) - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 25.11.20191A\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nwxl 2151$7 - 2019 fkdje\u00efn\u00be ui 25 jeks i\u00f7od - 2019'11'25No. 2151/7 - MONDAY, NOVEMBER 25, 2019\n\nEXTRAORDINARYThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n(Published by Authority)PART I : SECTION (I) \u2014 GENERALGovernment Notifications\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nDirection No. 69\n\nCONSUMER AFFAIRS AUTHORITY ACT, No. 09 OF 2003\n\nDirection under Section 10(1)(a)\n\nACTING under the powers vested in it by Section 10(1)(a) of the Consumer Affairs Authority Act, No. 09 of 2003, theConsumer Affairs Authority directs all manufacturers, importers, distributors and traders of float operated valves andspare parts, thereof that on each and every pack, following information shall be printed legibly and indelibly in Sinhala,Tamil & English languages.\n\n1. Brand Name\n\n2. Name of the Product/spare part\n\n3. Name and address of the Manufacturer, Contact details of the Manufacturer, if the product is manufactured/\n\nassembled in Sri Lanka.\n\n4. Name, Address and contact details of the importer\n\n5. Country of Origin (Factory Location)\n\n6. Registration Number issued by the Sri Lanka Standards Institution\n\n7. Batch Identification Number/Code\n\n8. Maximum Retail Price\n\n9. Nominal size of the valve\n\n10. Pressure Category (Low/Medium/High)\n\n11. Body Pattern Number\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk1A - PG 4771\u2014 217 (11/2019)\n\nI fldgi ( ^I& fPoh - YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'11'25PART I : SEC. (I) - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 25.11.20192A\n\n12. Material of the Float\n\n13. Installation instructions\n\nThis Directon shall come into effect from 1st June, 2020.\n\nBy Order of the Consumer Affairs Authority,\n\nDR. LALITH N. SENAWEERA,Chairman.\n\nColombo,22nd November, 2019."
