    "chunk_text": "THE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nDeclaration under Section 7\n\nMy Reference No.: 3/5/DO/ms'ke'm/02.\n\nLand Ministry Reference No.: 4-3/9/2012/IR/336.\n\nI, hereby give notice, under Sub section (1) of Section 7 ofthe Land Acquisition Act, as amended by the LandAcquisition (Amendment)Act, No. 28 of 1964, that theGovernment intends to acquire the following Land/servitudewhich is required for a public purpose.\n\nDescription of the land or Servitude to be acquired:\n\nTwo (2) Allotments of land in total extent of about 0.1829Hectares, depicted in F.V.P. 1359, Sheet No. 31, SupplementNo. 27 and Lots 308-309 (''324 Estate\") situated in Nelawa in453 Aluthgama Grama Niladhari Division of, MahagalbodaEgoda Korale, in Divisional Secretary's Division of Ganewatta,Kurunegala District in the North Western Province andbounded as follows:\n\n01. Lot No. 308; Estate - Kuda Aluthgama Henyaya;Claimant: State; Extent:0.1647 Hectare.\n\nBoundaries:\n\nNorth: Lot No. 309 and H 990 G; East: Lot No. H 990G andWelikade (F.V.P.1356) Village Boundary; South: Welikade(F.V.P.1356) Village Boundary; West: Lot No. 309.\n\n02. Lot No. 309; Road - Kuda Aluthgama Henyaya;Claimant: State; Extent:0.0182 Hectare.\n\nBoundaries:\n\nNorth: Lot No. 93 and H 990G; East: Lot No. 308; South: LotNo. 308 and Welikade (F.V.P.1356) Village Boundary; West:Lot No. 93.\n\nOne (1) Allotment of land in total extent of about 0.4485Hectare, depicted in F.V.P.1268, Sheet No. 16, Supplement No.16 and Lot 1463 (\"324 Estate\") situated in Rambawew in 441Neerawiya Grama Niladhari Division of, ThiththaweligandaheKorale, in Divisional Secretary's Division of Ganewatta,Kurunegala District in the North Western Province andbounded as follows:\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www. documents.gov.lk\n\nG 31573 - 47 (2019/11)\n\nwxl 2151$25 - 2019 fkdje\u00efn\u00be ui 27 jeks nodod - 2019'11'27\n\nNo. 2151/25 \u2013 WEDNESDAY, NOVEMBER 27, 2019\n\nThe Gazette of the Democratic S