    "chunk_text": "The Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n\u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba\n\n\u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2151/41 - 2019 \u0dd9\u0db1\u02a3\u0dc0\u0dd0\u023c\u0db6\u0259 \u0db8\u0dc3 28 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u01e7 \u022f\u0dc4\u0dc3\u0dca\u0db4\u01af\u01e6\u0daf\u0dcf - 2019.11.28\n\nNo. 2151/41 \u2013 THURSDAY, NOVEMBER, 28, 2019\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART I : SECTION (I) \u2014 GENERAL\n\nGovernment Notifications\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n1A - G31588 - 27 (2019/11)\n\nDEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT INFORMATION\n\nGuidelines for the issuing of official media accreditation cards for the year 2020 THE Department of Government Information issues official accreditation for professional journalists with the view of creating quality media practices and culture that enables them to perform their duties without any obstruction, and to enhance the professional quality and dignity of journalists. An individual who collects news and information, edits the collected information, and communicates that information to subscriber/reader is considered as a news reporter/journalist for issuing of media accreditation. Accreditation will be issued only for professional journalists who are engaged in the said task. It is requested from all heads of print and electronic media institutions and heads of news and current affairs sections, to take necessary action to recommend professional journalists only for issuing of this accreditation. The Head of the Institution/News Director/Chief Editor or the relevant authority should be responsible for the schedule submitted by that media institution for obtaining accreditation. Relevant parties are expected to pay their attention to following documents and criteria which are required for the issuing of accreditation.\n\n2 A I \u0dd9\u0d9a\u02a3\u0da7\u0dc3: (1) \u0dd9\u014e\u0daf\u0dba - \u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba - 2019.11.28 PART (I): SEC. (I) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 28.11.2019"
