    "chunk_text": "I fldgi ( ^I& fPoh - YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'11'28PART I : SEC. (I) - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 28.11.20191A\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nwxl 2151$50 - 2019 fkdje\u00efn\u00be ui 28 jeks n%yiam;skaod - 2019'11'28No. 2151/50 - THURSDAY, NOVEMBER 28, 2019\n\nEXTRAORDINARYThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n(Published by Authority)PART I : SECTION (I) \u2014 GENERALGovernment Notifications\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nPILGRIMAGE ORDINANCE (CHAPTER 175)\n\nThe Pageant in which the Statute of Deity Sri Sumana Saman and The Enclouser Casket with Relics willbe carried to the Sri-Pada\n\nEIGHT years after the entering into the world great Buddha-hood, place the respectful foot emblem on the top of theSamantha-Kuta Summit in view of the invitation of the deity Sri Sumana Saman and made Sri Lanka purified. On that dayonwards it was respected and worshiped and reverenced by the Kings and high esteems :-\n\nThe statute of the deity Sri Sumana Saman is deposited in the Deity's Palace in the Sri Pada Raja Maha ViharaTemple situated in Galpoththawala of Kuttapitiya Village in the Pelmadulla of Nawadum Korale of Ratnapura District inthe Sabaragamu Province during the off season.\n\n1. On the day before full moon poya of Unduwap of the year 2019, the ceremonial pageant in which the statute ofthe deity Sri Sumana Saman and the Enclosure Casket with relics will be carried on auspisious hour fromGalpoththawala Sri Rajamaha Vihara to mount Samantha-Kuta as follows :\n\n* The statute of the deity will be open to devotees for offerings and worshipping from 09.12.2019 atevening to 10.12.2019 early morning.\n\n* Early in the morning of 10.12.2019, the pageant will start from Sri Pada Raja Maha Vihara."
