    "chunk_text": "wxl 2152$6 - 2019 foie\u00efn\u00be ui 02 jeks i\u00f7od - 2019'12'02\n\nNo. 2152/6 \u2013 MONDAY, DECEMBER 02, 2019\n\nThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n(Published by Authority)PART III \u2013 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\nYS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www. documents.gov.lk\n\nG 31603 - 10 (12/2019)\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nNotice under Section 7\n\nLand Ministry Ref. No.: 4-3/6/2015/HW/215.\n\nMy Ref. No. : Pa/E/2/Ath22-2019/10.\n\nI hereby give notice under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of theLand Acquisition Act, that the Government intends to acquirethe following lands which are required for a public purpose:\n\nDescription of the land to be acquired:\n\nLot Nos. (1 - 14) Lots 14 allotments of land in Total Extentof about 0.1022 Hectare, Preliaminary Plan .No. CO 9797 anddated 31.01.2019 prepared by the Senior - Superintendent ofSurveyor of Colombo District on behalf of the SurveyorGeneral, situated in the Village of Bope in the Grama NiladhariDivision of Pahala Bope, No.459A in the Divisional Secretary\u2019sDivision of Padukka in Colombo District in the WesternProvince.\n\n01. Lot No. 1Name of land: Assmt. Nos. 695 and 701, Ingiriya Road;Description: Garden, contains a part of permanent buildingand a part of Toilet; Claimant: State; Original Claimant:Galhenage Chaminda Janith, No.390, Pahala Bope, Padukka(To finalize the land acquisition); Extent: 0.0319 Hectare.\n\n02. Lot No. 2Name of land: Cannot be found Assessment number, IngiriyaRoad; Description: Garden; Claimant: State; Original Claimant:Mahanthage Ajith Wijewardhana, No.389, Pahala Bope,Padukka (To finalize the land acquisition); Extent: 0.0039Hectare.\n\n03. Lot No. 3Name of land: Assmt.No. 805, Ingiriya Road; Description:Garden, contains a part of permanent building; Claimant: State;Original Claimant: Kudabalage Karunapala, No.263, Udumulla,Padukka (To finalize the land acquisition); Extent: 0.0027Hectare."
