    "chunk_text": "I fldgi ( ^I& fPoh - YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'12'03PART I : SEC. (I) - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 03.12.20191A\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nwxl 2152$11 - 2019 foie\u00efn\u00be ui 03 jeks w\u00d5yrejdod - 2019'12'03No. 2152/11 - TUESDAY, DECEMBER 03, 2019\n\nEXTRAORDINARYThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n(Published by Authority)PART I : SECTION (I) \u2014 GENERALGovernment Notifications\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nEXCISE ORDINANCE\n\nExcise Notification No. 07/2019\n\nEXCISE DUTY ON LIQUOR\n\nBY virtue of the powers vested in me by Section 22 of the Excise Ordinance (Chapter 52), as amended from time to time,I, Mahinda Rajapaksa, Minister of Finance, Economic and Policy Development do by this Order direct that, with effectfrom December 03, 2019 ;\n\n(1) Special Arrack manufactured in and issued from any licensed manufactory established in Sri Lanka shall belevied a duty at the rate of Rupees Three Thousand Eight Hundred (Rs. 3,800.00) per litre of alcohol ;\n\n(2) Molasses, Palmyrah, Coconut and Processed Arrack manufactured in and issued from any licensed manufactoryestablished in Sri Lanka shall be levied a duty at the rate of Rupees Four Thousand Fifty (Rs. 4,050.00) per litreof alcohol ;\n\n(3) Country made \u201cForeign\u201d spirits manufactured in Sri Lanka shall be levied on a duty at the rate of Rupees FourThousand One Hundred Fifty (Rs. 4,150.00) per litre of alcohol ;\n\n(4) Malt Liquor manufactured in and issued from any licensed brewery established in Sri Lanka shall be levied ona duty at the rate of Rupees Three Thousand Two Hundred (Rs. 3,200.00) per litre of alcohol ;\n\n(5) Liquors (other than toddy or any liquor made from any cereal) manufactured by process other than distillationfrom natural products of the Palm Tree or any other plant manufactured in Sri Lanka shall be levied on a duty atthe rate of Rupees Three Thousand Two Hundred (Rs. 3,200.00) per litre of alcohol ;"
