    "chunk_text": "II. Wattala-Mabola Urban Council in its functioning on 05.03.2019 or on a date adjacent to it, committing anoffence chargeable under Section 184(1)(d) of Urban Councils Ordinance by causing to sell, under anundervalued consideration and external to the prescribed tender procedure, the land in possession of Wattala-Mabola Urban Council containing 79 Perches in extent or an extent equal to that marked as Lot No. 1A2 inthe Plan No. 1377C dated 17th January 2018 made by Licensed Surveyor D. A. Weerakkody, and therebycausing a loss to the Urban Councils Fund.\n\nIV (w) jeks fldgi \u2014 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'12'03PART IV(A) \u2014 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 03.12.20192A\n\nMatters/allegations to be inquired in relation to the Chairman of Wattala-Mabola Urban Council-\n\nI. While functioning as the Chairman of Wattala-Mabola Urban Council, committing an offence chargeableunder Section 184(1)(e) of the Urban Councils Ordinance during the period of 21.05.2018 to 13.07.2018or during a period adjacent to it by taking action to obtain an undervalued consideration to the land inpossession of Wattala-Mabola Urban Council containing 79 Perches in extent or an extent equivalent tothat marked as Lot No. 1A2 of the Plan No. 1377C dated 17th January 2018 made by Licensed SurveyorD. A. Weerakkody, stating that the said land will be sold on deed of transfer to Melco Oxygen Company Ltd."
